# BuildKit reads this file, beside the Dockerfile of the same name, in place of the context's own .dockerignore. The
# context is addons/, every add-on and the kit they share; this build reads the kit's module and the AX add-on's, and
# nothing else enters the context. Dockerfile, Dockerfile.ax and Dockerfile.e2e each have this same file.
*
!kit
!ax
# kind holds the end-to-end test's values and Agent Kourier config, not the image's.
ax/kind
ax/bin
**/*.md
**/*.test
**/.git
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/kubeconfig*
# A local run's SQLite store and its journal files.
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
